 "name_en": "Document and Reporting Compliance (5XU)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Document and Reporting Compliance (5XU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Document and Reporting Compliance (formerly SAP S/4HANA for Advanced Compliance Reporting &amp; SAP Document Compliance) allows a customer to comply with e-invoicing, e-reporting, and statutory reporting obligations. With the activation of this scope item, you can activate and control the visibility of advanced features on country level. To see a full list of the advanced features, check the latest version of the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> feature and scope description.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable visibility of advanced features of Document and Reporting Compliance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain support for business partner correspondence</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable workflow functionality for statutory reporting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform analytics and preview data for statutory reports and electronic documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make manual adjustments for statutory reports</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Collaborate with SAP CoPilot</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Exchange e-invoices and eDocuments in real-time scenarios</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adapt statutory reporting and e-invoicing scenarios to your needs: Extend our solution and build your own reports or scenarios</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>凭证和报表合规性 (5XU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Document and Reporting Compliance（之前为面向高级合规性报表的 SAP S/4HANA 和 SAP Document Compliance）允许客户遵守电子发票、电子报告和法定报告义务。激活此范围项目后，您可以在国家/地区级别激活和控制高级功能的可见性。要查看高级功能的完整列表，请查看最新版本的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 功能和范围描述。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">启用凭证和报表合规性高级功能的可见性。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ab3b9624c724dc1b27b62bb1b8a137c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获得对业务伙伴信函的支持</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">启用法定报表的工作流功能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行法定报表和电子凭证的分析和预览数据。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">对法定报表进行手动调整</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与 SAP CoPilot 协作</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在实时场景中交换电子发票和 eDocument</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据您的需求调整法定报告和电子发票场景：扩展我们的解决方案并构建您自己的报表或场景</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
